<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>BEN Financials New Fund Request Form</title>
    <style>
        @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
        .page {
            width: 794px; height: 1123px;
            padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
            overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
            position: relative;
            font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
        }
        .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
        h1, h2, h3 { font-family: "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans", Arial, sans-serif; }
        .form-section { margin-bottom: 20px; }
        .label { font-weight: bold; display: inline-block; width: 150px; }
        .input-field { border-bottom: 1px solid #000; min-width: 100px; display: inline-block; }
        .full-width-input { border-bottom: 1px solid #000; width: 100%; }
        .table-header { font-weight: bold; border-bottom: 1px solid #000; }
        table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 10px; }
        td { padding: 5px 0; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="page">
        <div style="text-align: right; font-size: 10pt;">See the next page for instructions on how to complete this form.</div>
        <h1 style="text-align: center; font-size: 16pt;">BEN Financials New Fund Request Form</h1>
        <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Use this form to request a New Fund Number. Complete all information and return completed forms to Trust Administration at FMC Tower, 2929 Walnut Street, Suite 300. You will be notified via e-mail of the New Fund Number. Please direct any questions regarding the completion of this form or the status of the request to Irma T. Lerma Ext. 8-2682 or <span data-field="contact_email">{{ contact_email }}</span>.</p>

        <div class="form-section">
            <p style="font-weight: bold;">For Trust Administration Use Only:</p>
            <table>
                <tr>
                    <td style="width: 25%;">Date Fund Established:</td>
                    <td style="width: 25%;"><span data-field="date_established">{{ date_established }}</span></td>
                    <td style="width: 25%;">Completed by (initials):</td>
                    <td style="width: 25%;"><span data-field="completed_by_initials">{{ completed_by_initials }}</span></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>ATLAS Mapping:</td>
                    <td><span data-field="atlas_mapping">{{ atlas_mapping }}</span></td>
                    <td>FUND #:</td>
                    <td><span data-field="fund_number">{{ fund_number }}</span></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>CNAC</td>
                    <td><span data-field="cnac">{{ cnac }}</span></td>
                    <td>ORG</td>
                    <td><span data-field="org_code">{{ org_code }}</span></td>
                    <td>BC</td>
                    <td><span data-field="bc_code">{{ bc_code }}</span></td>
                    <td>FUND</td>
                    <td><span data-field="fund_code">{{ fund_code }}</span></td>
                    <td>OBJ</td>
                    <td><span data-field="obj_code">{{ obj_code }}</span></td>
                    <td>PROG</td>
                    <td><span data-field="prog_code">{{ prog_code }}</span></td>
                    <td>CREF</td>
                    <td><span data-field="cref_code">{{ cref_code }}</span></td>
                </tr>
            </table>
        </div>

        <div class="form-section">
            <p style="font-weight: bold;">Please complete all of the following information:</p>
            <p>Fund Name: <span data-field="fund_name_scalar">{{ fund_name_scalar }}</span></p>

            <p>Fund Type (check one): True Endowment Fund (4XXXXXX) _________ Term Endowment Fund (4XXXXXX) _________</p>
            <p>Quasi-Endowment Fund (4XXXXXX) _________ Agency Fund (9XXXXXX) _________ Restricted Operating Term Gift Fund (6XXXXXX) _________</p>
            <p>Unrestricted Operating Gift Fund (6XXXXXX) _________ Capital Project Gift Fund (6XXXXXX) _________</p>
        </div>

        <div class="form-section">
            <p style="font-weight: bold;">Responsible ORG: _________________________ (The Responsible ORG is the organizational unit that has fiduciary responsibility for all of the activity within the Fund. The organizational unit that has been designated the "Responsible ORG" for the Fund is authorized to view all combinations used with that Fund, regardless of the ORG Value.)</p>
            <p>ORG (if different from Responsible ORG): _________________________ PROGRAM: _________________________ CREF: _________________________</p>
        </div>

        <div class="form-section">
            <p style="font-weight: bold;">Indirect Cost Recovery (Overhead) (check one): YES _________ NO _________</p>
        </div>

        <div class="form-section">
            <p style="font-weight: bold;">Purpose of New Fund: Include a brief description of the New Fund – the purpose, sources of funding, expense categories expected, and/or any restrictions. Examples of purpose include financial aid, academic program, research, student activities, etc. New Funds will not be created without supporting documentation. See instructions on next page for more information.</p>
            <div style="height: 100px; border: 1px solid #000; margin-top: 5px;">
                <!-- Placeholder for purpose description -->
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="form-section">
            <p style="font-weight: bold;">Requestor Information:</p>
            <table style="width: 100%;">
                <tr>
                    <td style="width: 30%;">Requestor (Print Name):</td>
                    <td style="width: 30%;"><span data-field="requestor_name">{{ requestor_name }}</span></td>
                    <td style="width: 20%;">School/Center #:</td>
                    <td style="width: 20%;"><span data-field="school_center_number">{{ school_center_number }}</span></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>E-mail address:</td>
                    <td><span data-field="requestor_email">{{ requestor_email }}</span></td>
                    <td>(Signature):</td>
                    <td><span data-field="requestor_signature">{{ requestor_signature }}</span></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Development Officer to notify (if any): Name:</td>
                    <td><span data-field="development_officer_name">{{ development_officer_name }}</span></td>
                    <td>Department:</td>
                    <td><span data-field="department_name">{{ department_name }}</span></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Telephone #:</td>
                    <td><span data-field="telephone_number">{{ telephone_number }}</span></td>
                    <td>Email address:</td>
                    <td><span data-field="development_officer_email">{{ development_officer_email }}</span></td>
                </tr>
            </table>
        </div>

        <div class="form-section">
            <p style="font-weight: bold;">Approvals:</p>
            <p>School/Center: _________________________ Administrator: _________________________</p>
            <p> (Print Name): <span data-field="approver_print_name">{{ approver_print_name }}</span> (Signature): <span data-field="approver_signature">{{ approver_signature }}</span></p>
        </div>

        <div class="form-section">
            <p style="font-weight: bold;">Distributions:</p>
            <p>Please list other School/Center staff to be notified of new fund number here:</p>
            <div style="height: 100px; border: 1px solid #000; margin-top: 5px;">
                <!-- Placeholder for distribution list -->
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>